{
  "info": {
    "name": "Med&Fis — API Completa v2",
    "_postman_id": "medfis-api-v2",
    "description": "Colección completa Med&Fis. Base URL: http://localhost:8080/api\n\nFLUJO DE PRUEBA:\n1. AUTH → Login Auxiliar → token se guarda automáticamente\n2. CONSENTIMIENTOS → Crear Escleroterapia → consent_id se guarda\n3. AUTH → Login Médico → nuevo token\n4. NOTIFICACIONES → GET → ver alerta\n5. CONSENTIMIENTOS → Aprobar (Visto Bueno)\n6. NOTIFICACIONES → GET → ver aprobación\n\nCuentas:\n- rafael.marrero@medfis.com / medico123 (MÉDICO)\n- admin@medfis.com / admin123 (ADMINISTRADOR)\n- auxiliar@medfis.com / auxiliar123 (AUXILIAR)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url",   "value": "http://localhost:8080/api", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token",      "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "consent_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "user_id",    "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "notif_id",   "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 AUTH",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login — Médico",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": [
            "var r = pm.response.json();",
            "if (r.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', r.token);",
            "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "pm.test('Token recibido', () => pm.expect(r.token).to.be.a('string'));",
            "pm.test('Rol es MEDICO', () => pm.expect(r.rol).to.equal('MEDICO'));"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"rafael.marrero@medfis.com\",\n  \"password\": \"medico123\"\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — Administrador",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": [
            "var r = pm.response.json();",
            "if (r.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', r.token);",
            "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "pm.test('Rol es ADMINISTRADOR', () => pm.expect(r.rol).to.equal('ADMINISTRADOR'));"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@medfis.com\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — Auxiliar",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": [
            "var r = pm.response.json();",
            "if (r.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', r.token);",
            "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "pm.test('Rol es AUXILIAR', () => pm.expect(r.rol).to.equal('AUXILIAR'));"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"auxiliar@medfis.com\",\n  \"password\": \"auxiliar123\"\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — Credenciales inválidas (→ 401)",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": [
            "pm.test('401 Unauthorized', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"nadie@medfis.com\",\n  \"password\": \"wrong\"\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /auth/me — Perfil actual",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": [
            "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "pm.test('Tiene email', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property('email'));"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/me"
